--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: H11_4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: His friends cackle in response. Then, the room fills with a painful silence.
      People are definitely looking at us now, even if some are pretending not to.
      Mr. Horse stops with his movement and faces in my direction with a slightly
      confused expression. He glances back around the room, noticing the uncomfortable
      suspense hanging in the air.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What is this dude's problem anyway? Mr. Horse wasn't feeling at ease with
      everyone seeing him already. Now it's only gonna be worse with all of the attention
      being drawn to him.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I believe I need a short break.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 1
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 1
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He does seem a bit out of breath to be fair, but surely, he needs to get
      away from these piercing stares more than anything.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What's with the long face?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 64d8596f837844dc9a6de66f43ba811f, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I watch as he retreats to a more private area of the gym.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "And he gallops away\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dd01d3b0a4834cadae86b4e8dc786e45, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Another round of laughter echoes from the group.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What a bunch of idiots. What do I do?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0edfb2c7f1f8272498381ab59722dc9a, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0df59fcc23b94e75b384eeced8ea790a, type: 2}
